cod4x-rust

This project studies and reimplements behavior from:
https://github.com/callofduty4x/CoD4x_Server
Pinned revision: ddd65fce1a1093017bad2dbb6840d75d11c0d56f

The message/index codecs, envelopes, commands, info strings, and static Huffman
tables follow src/msg.c, src/netchan.c, src/cmd.c, src/qshared.c, and src/huffman.c.
Their upstream notices include:
