Copyright (C) 1999-2005 Id Software, Inc.

The upstream source headers offer GNU Affero General Public License version 3
or, at your option, any later version. This source-based Rust implementation
and its derived test fixtures use SPDX identifier AGPL-3.0-or-later. The full
upstream license text is retained in LICENSE.

tools/generate_message_vectors.py extracts selected original C functions only
into a temporary compatibility oracle. The product contains no C or assembly
runtime component. Original upstream notices remain applicable to the extracted
reference material and derived fixtures.

Legacy numeric/vector helper oracles additionally study selected functions from
src/cscr_variable.cpp and VectorCompare from src/q_math.c, with macros from
src/q_math.h. The pinned math header retains the Id Software notice above.
The bounded pool/ref/string/error harness services are replacements used only
for tests; the product does not contain the original runtime.

Other upstream components and bundled third-party libraries have not been
imported. Their licensing and attribution must be inventoried before reuse.
Commercial game assets, operator configurations, tokens, and credentials are
not part of this repository.

This project is independent of the official CoD4X project and of Activision.
